---
import Analytics from '../components/Analytics.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import ShareBar from '../components/ShareBar.astro';
import SiteNav from '../components/SiteNav.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <Analytics />
    <title>The Loud Cry — Come Out of Her, My People | Revelation 18:4 | SundayLaw.com</title>
    <meta name="description" content="The Loud Cry of Revelation 18:4 is heaven's final call to come out of Babylon. As the Midnight Cry joined the Second Angel in 1844, so the Loud Cry joins the Third Angel at the end. The corruptions since October 22, 1844 — church and state united April 15, 1904 — the Image of the Beast.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="Loud Cry, Revelation 18:4, Come Out of Her, Babylon, Second Angel, Third Angel, Midnight Cry, 1904, Image of the Beast, 501c3, SDA corporation, General Conference">
    <meta property="og:title" content="The Loud Cry — Come Out of Her, My People | Revelation 18:4">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Heaven's final amplified call: Come out of Babylon. The pattern of the Midnight Cry + Second Angel repeated in the Loud Cry + Third Angel. The corruptions since 1844 exposed.">
    <meta property="og:type" content="article">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://sundaylaw.com/loud-cry">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://sundaylaw.com/images/shield_sundaylaw.com_the_final_warning_logo.jpg">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://sundaylaw.com/loud-cry">
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": "The Loud Cry — Come Out of Her, My People",
      "description": "The Loud Cry of Revelation 18:4 joins the Third Angel's Message just as the Midnight Cry joined the Second Angel in 1844 — a final call out of Babylon, exposing the corruptions since October 22, 1844.",
      "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "SundayLaw.com" },
      "url": "https://sundaylaw.com/loud-cry"
    }
    </script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Crimson+Text:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #0a0a2e;
        --bg-soft: #0d0d3a;
        --ink: #fef3c7;
        --ink-muted: #9ca3af;
        --gold: #d4a537;
        --gold-soft: #fcd34d;
        --amber: #f59e0b;
        --crimson: #b91c1c;
        --crimson-soft: #ef4444;
        --line: rgba(212,165,55,0.22);
        --line-soft: rgba(212,165,55,0.12);
      }

      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        color: var(--ink);
        background: #0a0a2e;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      .serif { font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif; }
      .gold { color: var(--gold); }
      .text-gold { color: var(--gold-soft); }
      .text-red { color: #f87171; }
      .text-crimson { color: #fca5a5; }

      /* ===== NAV ===== */
      .nav {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 100;
        background: rgba(5,5,30,0.94);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .nav-wrap { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }

      .nav-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0 22px;
      }

      .nav-row-top {
        gap: 28px;
        height: 62px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.10);
      }

      .nav-row-bottom {
        gap: 22px;
        height: 42px;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        overflow-x: auto;
        scrollbar-width: none;
      }

      .nav-brand {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        margin-right: auto;
      }

      .nav-brand img { height: 38px; width: auto; display: block; border-radius: 4px; }

      .nav-link {
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        white-space: nowrap;
        transition: color 0.18s;
      }

      .nav-link:hover { color: var(--gold-soft); }

      .nav-cta {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        height: 38px;
        padding: 0 18px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: var(--gold);
        color: #111;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        transition: background 0.18s;
      }

      .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--gold-soft); }

      .nav-bottom-link {
        color: rgba(156,163,175,0.8);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
        white-space: nowrap;
        transition: color 0.18s;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .nav-bottom-link:hover { color: var(--gold-soft); }
      .nav-bottom-link.active { color: #fca5a5; }

      .menu-btn {
        display: none;
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .mobile-nav {
        display: none;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 14px 22px 18px;
        background: rgba(5,5,30,0.97);
      }

      .mobile-nav.open { display: grid; gap: 6px; }

      .mobile-nav a {
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 8px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      }

      .mobile-nav a:hover { color: var(--gold-soft); }

      /* ===== HERO ===== */
      .hero {
        position: relative;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .hero-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a0000 0%, #2d0505 30%, #0a0a2e 70%, #050518 100%);
      }

      .hero-overlay {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%, rgba(185,28,28,0.22) 0%, transparent 65%);
      }

      .hero-overlay2 {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center bottom, rgba(212,165,55,0.06), transparent 55%);
      }

      .hero-stripe {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        height: 4px;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--crimson), rgba(212,165,55,0.6), var(--crimson), transparent);
        z-index: 3;
      }

      .hero-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 960px;
        padding: 80px 28px 110px;
      }

      .hero-badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 8px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.4);
        background: rgba(185,28,28,0.12);
        color: #fca5a5;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 10vw, 7.5rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 0.95;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        color: #fef3c7;
        text-shadow: 0 4px 40px rgba(185,28,28,0.5), 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .hero h1 .red { color: #f87171; }
      .hero h1 .gold { color: var(--gold); }

      .hero-subtitle {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.3rem);
        color: rgba(254,243,199,0.82);
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .hero-verse {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: rgba(254,243,199,0.9);
        border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3);
        background: rgba(185,28,28,0.1);
        padding: 18px 28px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
        max-width: 700px;
      }

      .hero-verse cite {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 8px;
        color: #fca5a5;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      .hero-btns {
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 52px;
      }

      .btn-primary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        height: 52px;
        padding: 0 28px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: var(--crimson);
        color: #fff;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.2s;
        border: none;
      }

      .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--crimson-soft); transform: translateY(-2px); }

      .btn-gold {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        height: 52px;
        padding: 0 28px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: var(--gold);
        color: #111;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }

      .btn-gold:hover { background: var(--gold-soft); transform: translateY(-2px); }

      .btn-outline {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        height: 52px;
        padding: 0 28px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(254,243,199,0.3);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }

      .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold-soft); }

      .btn-sm {
        height: 40px;
        padding: 0 18px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }

      .hero-stats {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 48px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        padding-top: 38px;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2);
      }

      .hero-stat .num {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #f87171;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .hero-stat .label {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        margin-top: 6px;
        max-width: 130px;
      }

      /* ===== SECTIONS ===== */
      .section { padding: 80px 22px; position: relative; }

      .section-dark {
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0a0a2e, #080828, #0a0a2e);
      }

      .section-warm {
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0a0a2e, #100820, #0a0a2e);
      }

      .section-crimson {
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0a0a2e, #1a0505, #0a0a2e);
      }

      .section-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .section-narrow { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; }

      .section-stripe-top {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
        height: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(212,165,55,0.35), transparent);
      }

      .section-stripe-red {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
        height: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(185,28,28,0.6), transparent);
      }

      /* ===== SECTION HEADINGS ===== */
      .sh { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 52px; }

      .sh-eyebrow {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 6px 16px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(212,165,55,0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.28);
        color: var(--gold-soft);
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .sh-eyebrow-red {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 6px 16px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(185,28,28,0.12);
        border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3);
        color: #fca5a5;
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .sh h2 {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #fef3c7;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      .sh p {
        margin-top: 14px;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        max-width: 720px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
      }

      .sh-deco {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .sh-line { height: 1px; width: 52px; background: rgba(212,165,55,0.4); }
      .sh-line-red { height: 1px; width: 52px; background: rgba(185,28,28,0.5); }

      .sh-star { width: 16px; height: 16px; color: var(--gold); }
      .sh-star-red { width: 16px; height: 16px; color: #f87171; }

      /* ===== QUOTE BLOCKS ===== */
      .qb {
        border-left: 4px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.5);
        padding: 20px 20px 20px 24px;
        border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
        background: rgba(212,165,55,0.06);
      }

      .qb p {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.12rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: rgba(254,243,199,0.92);
        font-style: italic;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .qb cite {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 10px;
        color: var(--gold-soft);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      .qb-red {
        border-left-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.5);
        background: rgba(185,28,28,0.07);
      }

      .qb-red p { color: rgba(254,243,199,0.88); }
      .qb-red cite { color: #fca5a5; }

      /* ===== EGW STYLE ===== */
      .egw {
        border-left: 4px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.5);
        padding: 20px 20px 20px 26px;
        border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
        margin: 22px 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20,20,60,0.7), rgba(10,10,48,0.7));
        border: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.18);
        border-left: 4px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.55);
      }

      .egw p {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: rgba(254,243,199,0.9);
        font-style: italic;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .egw cite {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 10px;
        color: var(--gold-soft);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      /* ===== PATTERN TABLE ===== */
      .pattern-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: separate;
        border-spacing: 0 8px;
        margin: 32px 0;
      }

      .pattern-table th {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--gold-soft);
        text-align: left;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.3);
        background: rgba(10,10,46,0.9);
      }

      .pattern-table td {
        padding: 16px 18px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        background: rgba(20,20,68,0.5);
      }

      .pattern-table tr td:first-child { border-radius: 10px 0 0 10px; border-left: 3px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.3); }
      .pattern-table tr td:last-child { border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; }
      .pattern-table .row-red td { background: rgba(40,5,5,0.5); }
      .pattern-table .row-red td:first-child { border-left-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.4); }
      .pattern-table td strong { color: #fef3c7; }
      .pattern-table .tag {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 3px 10px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      }

      .tag-gold { background: rgba(212,165,55,0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.35); color: var(--gold-soft); }
      .tag-red { background: rgba(185,28,28,0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3); color: #fca5a5; }

      /* ===== FEATURE CARDS ===== */
      .feature-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 22px;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      }

      .feature-card {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 28px 24px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20,20,68,0.8), rgba(10,10,48,0.8));
        transition: all 0.25s;
      }

      .feature-card:hover {
        border-color: rgba(212,165,55,0.45);
        transform: translateY(-3px);
      }

      .feature-card.red-card {
        border-color: rgba(185,28,28,0.3);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(40,5,5,0.8), rgba(10,10,48,0.8));
      }

      .feature-card.red-card:hover { border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.5); }

      .feature-card .fc-icon {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        display: block;
      }

      .feature-card h3 {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #fef3c7;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .feature-card p {
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      /* ===== COMPARE BOXES ===== */
      .compare-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; margin-bottom: 32px; }

      .compare-box {
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 28px 24px;
        border: 2px solid;
      }

      .compare-gold {
        border-color: rgba(212,165,55,0.45);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(28,20,0,0.75), rgba(10,10,48,0.85));
      }

      .compare-red {
        border-color: rgba(220,50,50,0.4);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(40,5,5,0.75), rgba(10,10,48,0.85));
      }

      .compare-label {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 5px 12px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .label-gold { background: rgba(212,165,55,0.14); border: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.4); color: var(--gold-soft); }
      .label-red { background: rgba(220,50,50,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(220,50,50,0.4); color: #f87171; }

      .compare-box h3 {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .compare-box ul {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
        display: grid;
        gap: 9px;
      }

      .compare-box ul li {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        align-items: flex-start;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        font-size: 0.94rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .compare-box ul li::before { content: '›'; color: var(--gold); flex-shrink: 0; font-weight: 700; }
      .compare-red ul li::before { color: #f87171; }
      .compare-result {
        margin-top: 16px;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .result-gold { background: rgba(212,165,55,0.12); color: var(--gold-soft); border: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.28); }
      .result-red { background: rgba(220,50,50,0.1); color: #f87171; border: 1px solid rgba(220,50,50,0.25); }

      /* ===== SQ (QUOTE/SCRIPTURE BOXES) ===== */
      .sq {
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 24px 22px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .sq-gold {
        background: rgba(212,165,55,0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.28);
      }

      .sq-dark {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20,20,68,0.7), rgba(10,10,46,0.8));
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      }

      .sq-red {
        background: rgba(185,28,28,0.09);
        border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25);
      }

      .sq p, .sq blockquote {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.06rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: rgba(254,243,199,0.9);
        font-style: italic;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .sq h3 {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #fef3c7;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .sq cite {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 10px;
        color: var(--gold-soft);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      .sq-red cite { color: #fca5a5; }

      /* ===== PDF DOCUMENT GRID ===== */
      .doc-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: 32px;
      }

      .doc-card {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20,20,68,0.82), rgba(10,10,48,0.85));
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 22px 18px;
        transition: all 0.25s;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .doc-card:hover {
        border-color: rgba(212,165,55,0.45);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      }

      .doc-card-icon {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }

      .doc-card h4 {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #fef3c7;
        line-height: 1.35;
        flex: 1;
      }

      .doc-card .doc-desc {
        font-size: 0.86rem;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .doc-card .doc-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 6px;
      }

      .doc-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        height: 34px;
        padding: 0 14px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.18s;
      }

      .doc-btn-gold {
        background: var(--gold);
        color: #111;
      }

      .doc-btn-gold:hover { background: var(--gold-soft); }

      .doc-btn-outline {
        border: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.3);
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        background: transparent;
      }

      .doc-btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold-soft); }

      .doc-featured {
        grid-column: span 2;
        border-color: rgba(212,165,55,0.4);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,24,0,0.85), rgba(10,10,48,0.9));
      }

      /* ===== CALLOUT BOX ===== */
      .callout {
        border: 2px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.55);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 28px 26px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(40,5,5,0.85), rgba(10,10,48,0.9));
        box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(185,28,28,0.18);
        margin: 32px 0;
      }

      .callout h3 {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #fff;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .callout p {
        color: #d1d5db;
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.85;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .callout p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

      /* ===== GRID LAYOUTS ===== */
      .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; }
      .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 22px; }

      /* ===== EYEBROW ===== */
      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(212,165,55,0.12);
        border: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.28);
        color: var(--gold);
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      .eyebrow-red {
        background: rgba(185,28,28,0.12);
        border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.3);
        color: #fca5a5;
      }

      /* ===== SPOTLIGHT WARNING BANNER ===== */
      .warn-banner {
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(127,29,29,0.92), rgba(180,83,9,0.88), rgba(127,29,29,0.92));
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        padding: 20px 28px;
        text-align: center;
        border-radius: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .warn-banner p {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #fff;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .warn-banner span { color: var(--gold-soft); }

      /* ===== EXTERNAL CALLOUT (144000.com) ===== */
      .ext-callout {
        border: 2px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.45);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 36px 32px;
        text-align: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,24,0,0.82), rgba(10,10,48,0.9));
        box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
        margin: 40px 0;
      }

      .ext-callout h3 {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #fef3c7;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .ext-callout p {
        color: #d1d5db;
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.85;
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 0 auto 22px;
      }

      .ext-callout a {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.45rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--gold);
        text-decoration: underline;
        transition: color 0.18s;
        display: inline-block;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .ext-callout a:hover { color: var(--gold-soft); }

      /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
      .site-footer {
        background: #050518;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(180,130,50,0.2);
      }

      .footer-banner {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 32px 22px 28px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.12);
      }

      .footer-banner p {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: rgba(254,243,199,0.8);
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 0 auto 8px;
      }

      .footer-banner cite {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--gold-soft);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-style: normal;
      }

      .footer-main {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 40px 22px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 32px;
      }

      .footer-col h4 {
        color: var(--gold-soft);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .footer-col p { color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.75; }

      .footer-col ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 9px; }

      .footer-col ul a { color: #9ca3af; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: color 0.18s; }
      .footer-col ul a:hover { color: var(--gold-soft); }

      .footer-brand-name { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
      .footer-brand-name span { font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; }
      .footer-brand-name span em { color: var(--gold); font-style: normal; }

      .footer-bottom {
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.1);
        padding: 20px 22px;
        text-align: center;
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .footer-bottom p { color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.85rem; }

      .footer-flags { display: flex; gap: 3px; }
      .flag-r { width: 22px; height: 14px; background: #b91c1c; border-radius: 2px 0 0 2px; }
      .flag-w { width: 22px; height: 14px; background: #f3f4f6; }
      .flag-b { width: 22px; height: 14px; background: #1e3a8a; border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0; }

      .footer-stripe {
        height: 4px;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--gold), rgba(185,28,28,0.6), var(--gold), transparent);
      }

      /* ===== BTT ===== */
      .btt {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 28px;
        right: 28px;
        width: 46px;
        height: 46px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--gold);
        color: #111;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(12px);
        transition: all 0.25s;
        z-index: 200;
      }

      .btt.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
      .btt:hover { background: var(--gold-soft); }

      /* ===== TIMELINE LIST ===== */
      .timeline {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 32px;
        margin: 28px 0;
      }

      .timeline::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        left: 10px;
        top: 8px;
        bottom: 8px;
        width: 2px;
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(239,68,68,0.6), rgba(212,165,55,0.4));
      }

      .tl-item {
        position: relative;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .tl-item::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        left: -26px;
        top: 6px;
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--crimson);
        border: 2px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.4);
      }

      .tl-item.gold::before { background: var(--gold); border-color: rgba(212,165,55,0.5); }

      .tl-date {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: #fca5a5;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }

      .tl-item.gold .tl-date { color: var(--gold-soft); }

      .tl-title {
        font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #fef3c7;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .tl-desc {
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        font-size: 0.93rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
      @media (max-width: 1100px) {
        .menu-btn { display: flex; }
        .nav-link { display: none; }
        .nav-cta { display: none; }
        .nav-row-bottom { display: none; }
        .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        .footer-main { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .compare-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .doc-featured { grid-column: span 1; }
        .footer-main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .pattern-table { font-size: 0.87rem; }
      }

      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .hero h1 { font-size: 3rem; }
        .section { padding: 52px 18px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>

    <SiteNav />

    <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-bg">
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
        <div class="hero-overlay2"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stripe"></div>

      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badge">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          Heaven&rsquo;s Final Amplified Warning &mdash; Revelation 18:1&ndash;4
        </div>

        <h1 class="serif">The <span class="red">Loud</span> <span class="gold">Cry</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">&ldquo;Come Out of Her, My People&rdquo;</p>

        <div class="hero-verse">
          &ldquo;And I heard another voice from heaven, saying, Come out of her, my people, that ye be not partakers of her sins, and that ye receive not of her plagues. For her sins have reached unto heaven, and God hath remembered her iniquities.&rdquo;
          <cite>&mdash; Revelation 18:4&ndash;5 (KJV)</cite>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-btns">
          <a href="#pattern" class="btn-primary">The Two-Message Pattern</a>
          <a href="#1904" class="btn-gold">April 15, 1904</a>
          <a href="#evidence" class="btn-outline">The Evidence</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div class="hero-stat">
            <div class="num serif">1844</div>
            <div class="label">Second Angel + Midnight Cry</div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-stat">
            <div class="num serif">1904</div>
            <div class="label">Church &amp; State United</div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-stat">
            <div class="num serif">Rev. 18</div>
            <div class="label">Loud Cry Joins Third Angel</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== SECTION 1: THE AMPLIFICATION PATTERN ===== -->
    <section id="pattern" class="section section-dark">
      <div class="section-stripe-top"></div>
      <div class="section-inner">

        <div class="sh">
          <div class="sh-deco">
            <div class="sh-line"></div>
            <svg class="sh-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="sh-line"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sh-eyebrow">The Pattern of Heaven</div>
          <h2 class="serif">The Same Warning &mdash; <span style="color:#f87171;">Amplified</span></h2>
          <p>The Loud Cry of Revelation 18 is not a new message. It is the same separation call of 1843&ndash;1844, now swelled to a final thunder. Heaven used the same pattern before: the Midnight Cry joined the Second Angel. At the end, the Loud Cry joins the Third Angel.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
          <table class="pattern-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Era</th>
                <th>Primary Message</th>
                <th>Amplifying Cry</th>
                <th>Result</th>
                <th>Reference</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>1843&ndash;1844</strong></td>
                <td><strong>Second Angel (Rev. 14:8)</strong><br><em style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#d1d5db;">&ldquo;Babylon is fallen, is fallen&rdquo;</em></td>
                <td><strong>Midnight Cry (Matt. 25:6)</strong><br><em style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#d1d5db;">&ldquo;Behold, the bridegroom cometh; go ye out&rdquo;</em></td>
                <td>God&rsquo;s people called <strong>OUT</strong> of fallen Protestant churches into the Advent movement</td>
                <td><span class="tag tag-gold">Matt. 25:6</span></td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="row-red">
                <td><strong>Final Days</strong></td>
                <td><strong>Third Angel (Rev. 14:9&ndash;12)</strong><br><em style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#d1d5db;">&ldquo;If any man worship the beast&hellip;&rdquo;</em></td>
                <td><strong>Loud Cry (Rev. 18:1&ndash;4)</strong><br><em style="font-size:0.88rem;color:#d1d5db;">&ldquo;Come out of her, my people&rdquo;</em></td>
                <td>Honest souls called <strong>OUT</strong> of Babylon&rsquo;s corruption into final readiness for the Bridegroom</td>
                <td><span class="tag tag-red">Rev. 18:4</span></td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:36px;">
          <div class="compare-box compare-gold">
            <span class="compare-label label-gold">The Second Angel</span>
            <h3 class="serif" style="color:#fef3c7;">Declares the Fall</h3>
            <p style="color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.8;">Announces the moral fall of Babylon &mdash; the Protestant churches that rejected the first angel&rsquo;s judgment-hour message in 1843&ndash;1844.</p>
            <div class="compare-result result-gold">"Babylon is fallen, is fallen." — Rev. 14:8</div>
          </div>
          <div class="compare-box compare-gold">
            <span class="compare-label label-gold">The Midnight Cry</span>
            <h3 class="serif" style="color:#fef3c7;">Calls God&rsquo;s People Out</h3>
            <p style="color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.8;">Joins the Second Angel with power, awakening the waiting virgins and calling them to go out and meet the Bridegroom before the door closes.</p>
            <div class="compare-result result-gold">"Go ye out to meet him." — Matt. 25:6</div>
          </div>
          <div class="compare-box compare-red">
            <span class="compare-label label-red">The Loud Cry</span>
            <h3 class="serif" style="color:#fef3c7;">Final Thunder</h3>
            <p style="color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.8;">Joins the Third Angel at the end with greater light and power, warning honest souls still inside corrupt systems to come out before the plagues fall.</p>
            <div class="compare-result result-red">"Come out of her, my people." — Rev. 18:4</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="egw" style="margin-top:36px;">
          <p>&ldquo;The message of the fall of Babylon, as given by the second angel, is repeated, with the additional mention of the corruptions which have been entering the churches since 1844. The work of this angel comes in at the right time to join in the last great work of the third angel&rsquo;s message as it swells to a loud cry.&rdquo;</p>
          <cite>&mdash; Ellen G. White, <em>Early Writings</em>, p. 277.1</cite>
        </div>

        <div class="egw">
          <p>&ldquo;This message seemed to be an addition to the third message, joining it as the midnight cry joined the second angel&rsquo;s message in 1844&hellip; proclaiming the fall of Babylon and calling upon God&rsquo;s people to come out of her.&rdquo;</p>
          <cite>&mdash; Ellen G. White, <em>Early Writings</em>, p. 277.2</cite>
        </div>

        <div class="egw">
          <p>&ldquo;When the messages of the three angels come prominently before the world again just before the second advent of Christ, the angel of Revelation 18:1 joins in the proclamation of the second angel in the message that &lsquo;Babylon is fallen.&rsquo; &lsquo;Come out of her, my people.&rsquo;&rdquo;</p>
          <cite>&mdash; Ellen G. White, <em>Early Writings</em>, Appendix, p. 304.1</cite>
        </div>

        <div class="egw">
          <p>&ldquo;The image to the beast represents <strong>ANOTHER religious body clothed with similar powers.</strong>&rdquo;</p>
          <cite>&mdash; Ellen G. White, <em>The Story of Redemption</em>, p. 381:2; <em>The Spirit of Prophecy</em>, Vol. 4, p. 277.2</cite>
        </div>

        <div class="egw">
          <p>Babylon = &ldquo;<strong>religious bodies that were once pure and have become corrupt.</strong>&rdquo;</p>
          <cite>&mdash; Ellen G. White, <em>The Great Controversy</em>, p. 382.3</cite>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== SECTION 2: WHAT WAS CALLED OUT, AND WHAT THE LOUD CRY EXPOSES ===== -->
    <section id="backsliding" class="section section-warm">
      <div class="section-stripe-red"></div>
      <div class="section-inner">

        <div class="sh">
          <div class="sh-deco">
            <div class="sh-line-red"></div>
            <svg class="sh-star-red" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="sh-line-red"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sh-eyebrow-red">The Danger of Return</div>
          <h2 class="serif">Do Not Go <span style="color:#f87171;">Back</span></h2>
          <p>The Third Angel&rsquo;s Message is a warning not to backslide into the very errors the pioneers cast off during the Second Angel&rsquo;s Cry in 1843&ndash;1844. The Loud Cry exposes the corruptions that have entered the churches since October 22, 1844.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="warn-banner">
          <p>&ldquo;The third angel&rsquo;s message was, and still is, a WARNING to the saints to &lsquo;hold fast,&rsquo; and not go back, and <strong>&lsquo;receive&rsquo; THE MARKS which the virgin band got rid of, during the second angel&rsquo;s cry.&rdquo;</strong></p>
          <p style="margin-top:12px;font-size:1rem;color:#fcd34d;font-style:normal;">— James White, <em>A Word to the Little Flock</em>, p. 11</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:32px;">
          <div>
            <div class="sq sq-dark">
              <h3 class="serif">What Was Cast Off in 1843&ndash;1844</h3>
              <p style="font-style:normal;color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.85;margin-top:8px;">The early Advent movement separated from errors the Protestant Reformation had failed to fully leave behind. James White named them plainly:</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sq sq-gold" style="margin-top:0;">
              <p>&ldquo;The greatest fault we can find in the Reformation is, the Reformers stopped reforming. Had they gone on, and onward, till they had left the last vestige of Papacy behind &mdash; such as natural immortality, sprinkling, the trinity, and Sunday-keeping &mdash; the church would now be free from her unscriptural errors.&rdquo;</p>
              <cite>&mdash; James White, <em>Review &amp; Herald</em>, February 7, 1856, Vol. 7, No. 19, p. 148</cite>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="compare-box compare-red" style="height:100%;">
              <span class="compare-label label-red">Errors to Never Return To</span>
              <h3 class="serif" style="color:#fef3c7;">The Marks Cast Off in 1844</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Sunday-keeping (man&rsquo;s tradition replacing God&rsquo;s 7th-day Sabbath)</li>
                <li>Natural immortality of the soul (contrary to Scripture)</li>
                <li>Sprinkling (replacing immersion baptism)</li>
                <li>The Trinitarian formula (vestiges of Papal doctrinal residue)</li>
                <li>Church and State union (the very system the pioneers fled)</li>
                <li>Corporate political incorporation under civil government</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="compare-result result-red">Heaven&rsquo;s command: Do not go back.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sq sq-dark" style="margin-top:28px;">
          <h3 class="serif">The Pattern of Return</h3>
          <p style="font-style:normal;color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.85;margin-top:8px;">Backsliding is not advancement. It is not &ldquo;maturity.&rdquo; It is not &ldquo;institutional strength.&rdquo; It is the slow, polished, respectable return to what God once called a people to leave. What Heaven exposed, many later excused. What the protest cast off, later generations took back up.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="egw" style="margin-top:24px;">
          <p>&ldquo;They had a bright light set up behind them at the first end of the path, which an angel told me was the Midnight Cry&hellip; Others rashly denied the light behind them&hellip; The light behind them went out, leaving their feet in perfect darkness.&rdquo;</p>
          <cite>&mdash; Ellen G. White, <em>Spiritual Gifts</em>, Vol. 2, p. 30.2</cite>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== SECTION 3: APRIL 15, 1904 ===== -->
    <section id="1904" class="section section-crimson">
      <div class="section-stripe-red"></div>
      <div class="section-inner">

